he minimum code required to demonstrate the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5382605863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5382711743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122728#issuecomment-5382711743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122728","id":5382711743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQNWpvw","user":{"login":"homebax-studios","id":180071507,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrusUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180071507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios","html_url":"https://github.com/homebax-studios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-22T21:33:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T21:33:15Z","body":"> CreatedBySeb\n> Hi, thank you for reporting your issue. For an MRP, we ask that the submitter provides the minimum possible project that demonstrates an issue and uploads it as a Zip archive so that the issue can be directly reproduced and debugged. Since various behaviours can be affected by other settings or files in a project, just providing instructions and a script excerpt will usually make reproduction difficult. My suggestion would be to either clone your project that is demonstrating the issue, then start removing any extraneous parts that are not required for the issue to be demonstrated, or to start a new project and copy over the minimum code required to demonstrate the issue.\n\nSure, I would like to provide the .zip of the project but the official size is 18.42gb. But it happens with any project. I don't know if the problem is with me. But I can confirm that I downloaded the official .zip which contained the godot .exe. I also tried reinstalling godot but the problem still occurs.\n\nEven a small project cannot be sent here:\n`<!-- Failed to upload \"c#-game.zip\" -->`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5382711743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5382723734","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122728#issuecomment-5382723734","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122728","id":5382723734,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQNXYlg","user":{"login":"homebax-studios","id":180071507,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrusUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180071507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios","html_url":"https://github.com/homebax-studios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/starred