either need to swap to 4.7.1 or wait for a new 4.7 version to be released. There's a fix present already in godot master, so you could cherry pick the fix yourself onto 4.7.2, or compile master yourself while you wait. I don't know of a workaround other than querying the physical keyboard state (which is what I do)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5428861382/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5447005463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122728#issuecomment-5447005463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122728","id":5447005463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRKq1Fw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T00:52:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T00:52:28Z","body":"Can you check if the issue is resolved in [4.8.dev4](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-8-dev-4/)?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5447005463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5448779833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122728#issuecomment-5448779833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122728","id":5448779833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRMXIOQ","user":{"login":"DreamyCecil","id":21009796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDA5Nzk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21009796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil","html_url":"https://github.com/DreamyCecil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DreamyCecil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T05:22:25Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T05:22:25Z","body":"Gonna report my results as well because this issue (and more) has also been bugging me.\n\nI tested the Shift key getting stuck in my project in 4.8.dev4 and it seems to behave almost like in 4.7.1 now, i.e. it doesn't get randomly stuck in the pressed state. I also tested the MRP from #122554 and it seems to work fine too.\n\n---\nBut there's still a weird thing that happens when you use it in combination with Num 0. I've described the previous behavior on 4.7.2 here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122554#issuecomment-5337567804\n\nWhat happens now is that when you hold Shift and then start holding Num 0, it's as if the Shift action gets \"suppressed\" and doesn't work anymore until I release Num 0. The way I'm using either key for actions is via `Input.is_action_pressed()` on separate mapped key actions inside `_physics_process()`.\n\nI know about the Shift+Num 0 combination invoking Insert but I feel like that's not how this should work because:\n1. I'm using individual keys for their respective actions instead of this combination.\n2. Num 0 still works for its respective action but not Shift while both of them are held. Shift only works for its action when it's held *after* Num 0.\n\nThis isn't as annoying of an issue as the Shift getting randomly stuck but I could still create a separate issue for this, if needed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5448779833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5489907702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122728#issuecomment-5489907702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122728","id":5489907702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRzlX9g","user":{"login":"MbsElectronics","id":87683451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjgzNDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87683451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics","html_url":"https://github.com/MbsElectronics","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MbsElectronics/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:35:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T06:36:12Z","body":"I had the same problem with an old FPV controller that had been working since engine version 4.1 and broke when I updated to 4.7.2. It's exactly the same problem as you with the Shift key and run mode. It looks like it's a regression in the engine itself. I solved the problem this way: I no longer check the Shift state in the _process() or _phisics_process(); instead, I created a Boolean variable and check the Shift in a _input(event). Then I check bool var in _phisics_processs(). This works very dood in version 4.7.2. Recomended:\n\nvar is_run_pressed:= false\n\nfunc _input(event):\n\n\tif event is InputEventKey:\n\t\tif event.is_action(input_run):\n\t\t\tif not event.is_echo():\n\t\t\t\tis_run_pressed = event.is_pressed()\n\nfunc _phisics_proces(delta):\n\nif is_run_pressed: \n\t\t_speed = run_speed   ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5489907702/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5979899288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122728#issuecomment-5979899288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122728","id":5979899288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZG4FmA","user":{"login":"homebax-studios","id":180071507,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrusUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180071507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios","html_url":"https://github.com/homebax-studios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/homebax-studios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-04T12:25:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T12:25:47Z","body":"It's already fixed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5979899288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]